  dialogue: I already got three emails labeled Urgebt already what a way to start
    the day
  firstChoice: you should answer them immediately if they're urgent
  secondChoice: careful it might be a trick
  firstChoiceResponse: Well thats what they want you to think soemtimes attackers
    label their email as urgent to trick us onto prioritizing and replying to them.
  secondChoiceResponse: Yeah. But don't worry i always double check on who sent the
    email first before taking it seriously.
